PrivateProfileChange_Header September 2026: Private Steam Profiles
PrivateProfileChange_Body As of September 2026, multiplayer servers are unable to verify your group membership if your profile is private. Valve have confirmed this is an intentional privacy-related fix. Click for workarounds and more info.
